[00:27.26]1. We’re gathered together, Jehovah our God,
[00:33.07]Accepting your warm invitation.
[00:38.88]Your Word is a lamp that lights up our pathway,
[00:45.60]The source of divine education.
[00:49.18](Chorus)
[00:52.76]Teach me your ways, and make me understand;
[00:59.28]Incline my ear to hear your wise command.
[01:06.52]Cause me to walk in ways of truth and right,
[01:13.12]And make your law my principal delight.
[01:47.61]2. Unreachably high is your wisdom, O God;
[01:51.26]Your judgments we find reassuring.
[01:58.65]Your Word is a source of unending wonder;
[02:03.65]Your sayings of truth are enduring.
[02:07.06](Chorus)
[02:10.46]Teach me your ways, and make me understand;
[02:16.46]Incline my ear to hear your wise command.
[02:23.46]Cause me to walk in ways of truth and right,
[02:29.46]And make your law my principal delight.